@baseUrl = https://localhost:7146
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Create administrator (multipart — Photo is optional, omit the part to skip it)
POST {{apiUrl}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=TrivoBoundary

--TrivoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="FirstName"

Jane
--TrivoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="LastName"

Doe
--TrivoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Email"

jane.doe.admin@example.com
--TrivoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Password"

Password123!
--TrivoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Username"

janedoeadmin
--TrivoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Biography"

Platform administrator overseeing matchmaking quality and moderation.
--TrivoBoundary--

### Login as administrator — copy "accessToken" from the response into @token above
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane.doe.admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Completed matches count — requires role "Administrator"
GET {{apiUrl}}/count/match-complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Active users count
GET {{apiUrl}}/count/user-active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Latest registered users (paginated)
GET {{apiUrl}}/last-user?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Last 10 banned users
GET {{apiUrl}}/banned-users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ban a user
PUT {{apiUrl}}/users/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6/ban
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unban a user
PUT {{apiUrl}}/users/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6/unban
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Latest matches (paginated)
GET {{apiUrl}}/last-match?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reported users count
GET {{apiUrl}}/count/users-report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
